@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+---
+"@beep/codegen-kit": patch
+"@beep/ecfr": patch
+"@beep/editor": patch
+"@beep/govinfo": patch
+"@beep/pacer": patch
+"@beep/qa-capture": patch
+"@beep/runpod": patch
+---
+
+OpenApi annotations on the handwritten HttpApi contracts (pacer, govinfo search, qa-capture
+collector), a contract-only `@beep/ecfr/contract` subpath export for docs consumers, a tsc-safe
+Match handler in the editor toolbar, and terse-effect law collateral pinned to explicit type
+arguments in codegen-kit and runpod.
